        <p class="film-synopsis" data-i18n="soft_lock_synopsis">
          Laura is a dancer who works as a bike courier to make ends meet. Over the course of
          one shift, as her patience is tested and her energy depletes, Laura learns she has the
          fortitude to survive the odds against her.
